 Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=Once%20again%2C%20she%20looks,Eloise.%20And%20Jacob%20understands.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e14","era":null,"summary":"Eloise and Millicent go to Nellick's mansion and find two unconscious servants and Nellick's body but no Jacob.","participants":["eloise-wicker","millicent","lord-nellick","jacob-hauken"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"major","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":236,"quote":"She finds two unconscious servants in the kitchen, and a body in the parlor: Lord Nellick.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=She%20finds%20two%20unconscious,the%20parlor%3A%20Lord%20Nellick.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Edge of the World","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Aysha U. Farah"],"date":"2021-10-29","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/edge-world-2021-10-29#:~:text=She%20finds%20two%20unconscious,the%20parlor%3A%20Lord%20Nellick.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Edge of the World\" by Aysha U. Farah. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 29 Oct 2021."}},{"id":"edge-world-2021-10-29-e15","era":null,"summary":"Eloise offers to work for Millicent and tells her to keep the seal.","participants":["eloise-wicker","millicent"],"location":"selhoff","importance":"minor","page":"stories/edge-world-2021-10-29","order":762,"story_date":"2021-10-29","storyline":"Innistrad: Crimson Vow","source":"wizards","paragraph":251,"quote":"\"I'